Alembic migrations for hermes-agent-framework.

The database is optional: the service falls back to in-memory stores when no
database is reachable (see src/hermes/db.py). Run migrations only when you want
persistent agent runs, tasks, approvals, and memory.

  # apply all migrations
  alembic upgrade head

  # autogenerate a new migration after changing src/hermes/models.py
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

The database URL is read from AppConfig.DATABASE_URL (env / .env) in env.py.
